# Depiction values

Follow the project skill `.agents/skills/add-depiction-value/SKILL.md`.

- Types, `Validate` and the read rules (`Readable`, `ReadableImage`) live in `core/depictionvalue`; storage goes through `depictionvalues.InsertTx` / `LookupTx` / `FromJoin`.
- Every reader that returns a depiction to the app goes through `Readable`.
- Schema changes go through catalog migrations.
